\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f0\fs22\lang9 NUMBERS AND YOU \par
LLOYD STRAYHORN\par
1980\par
\par
Your Personal Year\par
Forecast\par
Each year, we and our environment move through\par
different sets of conditions known as the \ldblquote universal\rdblquote  and \ldblquote personal\rdblquote\par
year cycles. The universal cycle is very easy to determine. You\par
simply add up the numbers of any year; this makes it simple to find\par
the numerical influence for any year, be it past, present, or future.\par
Let\rquote s take a year in the past, 1978. It adds up to a 7 (1 + 9 + 7 + 8\par
= 25; 2 + 5 = 7). Taking 2016, a year in the future, this adds up\par
to a 9 universal year (2 + 0 + 1 + 6 = 9). The universal cycle\par
affects all of us.\par
The personal year cycle, however, affects us individually in a\par
more personal or intimate way. I classify the personal year cycles\par
into four general categories:\par
Mental outlook, mood, and way of thinking.\par
The environment or conditions of things around you.\par
The attraction or assistance you\rquote re likely to encounter.\par
The health or physical well-being that may speed or hinder\par
your progress.\par
To find your very own personal year number, take your month\par
and day of birth and add it to the present year. Taking someone\par
born April 13th:\par
Determine your own personal year cycle in this manner. Don\rquote t\par
forget, add your month and day of birth to any year you wish to\par
know about.\par
\par
\par
\par
The 1 Personal Year\par
THEME:\par
Independence, new opportunities, planting seeds.\par
DESCRIPTION:\par
In a 1 personal cycle you have a chance to symbolically begin life\par
over again. This should be a year for all things new as well as new\par
opportunities and personal experiences. If you were born on the 1st,\par
10th, 19th, or 28th of the month, or under the sign of Leo or Aries,\par
this year should be all the more important. In this cycle, it\rquote s best for\par
you to strike out on your own in some way, to take the lead\par
wherever required. It\rquote s no accident that most people start their own\par
businesses or launch important projects and long-range plans under\par
this cycle. The 1 year represents planting, laying the groundwork for\par
the next nine years ahead. So choose and plant your seeds very\par
carefully.\par
LOVE/RELATIONSHIPS:\par
In this particular cycle, whether the relationship is personal,\par
business, or otherwise, it\rquote s an excellent time to get involved with\par
someone new, authoritative, or perhaps younger than yourself. If\par
you already have an established relationship, a renewal of some\par
kind may be just what you need\f1\emdash take a second honeymoon, or\par
renew your vows. In matters of romance or business, you\rquote ll find\par
those born under the signs of Leo, Aries, and Aquarius entering your\par
life, as well as those born on the 1st, 4th, 9th, 10th, 13th, 18th,\par
19th, 22nd, 27th, 28th, and 31st of the month. The months of\par
January, May, July, and October are likely to bring these persons\par
into your life and plans. Your colors of attraction are gold, yellow,\par
orange and golden brown.\par
HEALTH:\par
The emphasis during this cycle is on the eyes, such as problems\par
with astigmatism; the lungs; and the heart, as well as irregular\par
circulation or heart palpitations. It\rquote s best to start this cycle with a\par
medical checkup. Begin a new physical fitness program to meet the\par
busy year. The months to keep an eye on your own health as well as\par
the health of others are March, May, and August.\par
CAREER:\par
If you\rquote ve been wanting to make a break, to go for something\par
completely new in your career, this is certainly the year for it. More\par
major changes, improvements, or job independence take place\par
under this cycle than any other. Aggressiveness, decision-making\par
ability, leadership qualities, and the will to win impress others and\par
gain their assistance. If you\rquote re looking for work or making career\par
moves, Tuesday and Monday are your best days (in that order).\par
These are also good days to ask for a raise or promotion. Job or\par
career changes are likely to be more noticeable during April, May,\par
July and September.\par
TRAVEL:\par
The travel opportunities that come your way are likely to be new,\par
different, and exciting compared with the past. This year, travel may\par
be strongly connected with your career in some way, or simply offer\par
a change of scenery, a way to start life anew. January, April,\par
August, September, and October hold the strongest possibilities for\par
travel.\par
The 2 Personal Year\par
THEME:\par
Patience, companionship, harmony, and teamwork.\par
DESCRIPTION:\par
The major focus of a 2 personal cycle is on tact, cooperation, and\par
understanding. Whatever seeds you planted last year are now in the\par
germination stage. Changes are likely to be slow rather than rapid.\par
Gradually, but with purpose, changes take place in the environment\par
\emdash you might move from one location to another, even to another\par
city. Changes also occur in the home or in relationships with the\par
opposite sex. This is an excellent year to get what you want by\par
asking for favors rather than by forcing yourself on others. If you\par
were born under the sign of Cancer or Taurus, or if your birthday\par
falls on the 2nd, 11th, 20th, or 29th of the month, this year is all the\par
more important.\par
LOVE/RELATIONSHIPS:\par
Love, friends, and partnerships of some sort seem to be a\par
necessity. Members of the opposite sex tend to get more involved in\par
your life than normal. Engagements, marriages, even pregnancies\par
and births are strongly indicated for you or those close to you under\par
this cycle. The cosmic, intuitive, nurturing side of your nature is\par
likely to emerge. Since this is a very emotional cycle, deeply\par
influenced by the Moon, you may be extra sensitive to remarks or\par
suggestions. You\rquote re likely to find those under Cancer, Taurus, and\par
Libra coming into your life more. This also includes those born on\par
the 2nd, 6th, 7th, 11th, 15th, 16th, 20th, 24th, 25th, or 29th of the\par
month. Romantic and domestic events are especially strong during\par
April, June, and September. The colors of attraction are cream,\par
green, white, and blue.\par
HEALTH:\par
This personal cycle generally brings concerns with the stomach\par
and gastric problems of all kinds. Women may have female\par
problems during this period. Be selective when eating out, to avoid\par
possible ptomaine poisoning. In addition, tumors, and ulcers due to\par
emotional stress, could develop. Start off the year with a proper diet\par
program focusing on nutrition rather than weight gain or loss. Your\par
weight should adjust itself naturally if you eat properly. The months\par
of February, April, July especially, and November may show health\par
changes in some way.\par
CAREER:\par
Internal rather than external changes are likely in the workplace\par
when passing through this cycle. For example, you may find your\par
work area moving from one floor to another, or even relocating to\par
another building or area. You may also be assigned another task in\par
addition to your present responsibilities. Should you be in search of\par
work this year, schedule your appointments for Monday and Friday.\par
These are also excellent days to ask for a raise, promotion, or\par
transfer. The months of March, April, June, August, and December\par
are important for job moves or advances.\par
TRAVEL:\par
An excellent year for short trips up to a few days or of a\par
temporary nature. Trips by water or across water are also strongly\par
indicated. It\rquote s also possible that your geographical setting will be\par
changed or altered in some way before the year is over. You can\par
expect to take advantage of travel opportunities during the months\par
of March, July, August, and December.\par
The 3 Personal Year\par
THEME:\par
Imagination, expansion, self-improvement, and creation.\par
DESCRIPTION:\par
Happiness, growth, artistic and social developments, along with a\par
desire for self-improvement are among the many highlights in store\par
for you. Improving your image or reputation will add to your\par
popularity with others and the public. Doing something creative,\par
such as writing, painting, or making music, will add much to your\par
personal self-satisfaction. Be positive in attitude and action as much\par
as possible. The seeds you planted two years ago are likely to bear\par
fruit. If you were born under the sign of Pisces or Sagittarius, or if\par
your birthday falls on the 3rd, 12th, 21st, or 30th of the month, this\par
year should be all the more important.\par
LOVE/RELATIONSHIPS:\par
Love and romance are fanciful and flirty rather than serious.\par
Under this aspect, love relationships may be more fun and passing\par
fancy than domestic. You\rquote re likely to find relationships developing\par
with those younger than yourself. This also includes those born\par
under the signs of Pisces and Sagittarius, and those born on dates\par
that add up to 3, 6 or 9. During this particular cycle, the best\par
months to develop relationships are March, May, August, and\par
December.\par
HEALTH:\par
Out of the fun of it all, may come the strain of it all\emdash especially if\par
carried to excess. Health during this cycle may be stressed by\par
overwork, nervous strain, emotional outbursts and upsets. There\par
may be skin problems, low blood pressure or anemia, as well as foot\par
problems. The best medicine is not to overwork the mind and body\par
through too much work or play. Stay alert to health concerns during\par
January, March, June, and October.\par
CAREER:\par
Three is the number of expansion and personal growth, therefore\par
your career outlook should be bright. Develop a more positive,\par
ambitious attitude. Take a conscientious approach to your job\par
responsibilities. If you\rquote re looking for the right time to advance\par
yourself, or to ask for a raise or promotion, take interviews or tests,\par
select Thursday and Friday as your best days. Look for the months\par
of February, March, May, July, and November to bring better\par
opportunities.\par
TRAVEL:\par
Trips and travel during this cycle year are likely to be short, and\par
more in connection with fun and entertainment. On the other side of\par
the coin, however, chances are excellent for traveling to foreign\par
lands. Travel months strongly indicated this year are February,\par
June, July, and November.\par
The 4 Personal Year\par
THEME:\par
Foundation, organization, structure, work.\par
DESCRIPTION:\par
This cycle year, have a plan, a road map, or schedule for your\par
personal and business dealings. More may be required of you, which\par
may give you the feeling of being boxed-in, burdened, or pressured\par
in some way. This cycle generally suggests limitations, whether it\rquote s\par
emotional, physical, psychological, or economic. On the other hand,\par
you now have a chance to get yourself organized and to build a\par
solid and secure foundation for yourself. This year, be sure to ask,\par
\ldblquote who, what, where, when, why and how\rdblquote  about any activity,\par
project, or plan you wish to undertake. If you\rquote re an Aquarius, Leo,\par
or Gemini, or born on the 4th, 13th, 22nd, or 31st of any month,\par
this personal year cycle will be all the more important.\par
LOVE/RELATIONSHIPS:\par
Persons who are considered unconventional, odd, or unusual are\par
likely to be drawn to you in this cycle. Interestingly, those from the\par
past, someone older, or outside of your own ethnic, social, or\par
religious background may be drawn to you as well. A romance out\par
of left field is also indicated. Gemini, Leo, and Aquarius are the\par
likely favorites, as well as anyone whose birth number is 1, 4, 5, or\par
7. The best months for romance are February, April, July, and\par
November. Electric colors attract during this cycle, as do pastels and\par
halftones.\par
HEALTH:\par
Of all the personal year cycles, this one generally puts the most\par
stress on your physical well-being and psychological attitude.\par
Unpredictable and unexplainable behavior may occur during this\par
cycle. Odd or mysterious illnesses may develop, which could lead to\par
misdiagnoses, wrong medical treatment, even the wrong drug\par
prescription. Watch for changes in moods, mental attitudes, or\par
health during February, May, September, and November.\par
CAREER:\par
Since this cycle tends to bring the unexpected and extreme, this\par
may also happen in your job or career. For instance, one week you\par
may be happy and secure\emdash then the following week, quite\par
unexpectedly, you find yourself out of work, in a panic, looking for\par
another place of employment. Or you may be in a lull at work with\par
nothing developing, then suddenly you\rquote re pushed to the top. Life is\par
strange in a 4 cycle year. This cycle also tends to bring additional\par
burdens or responsibilities. Don\rquote t shun them, for there\rquote s a lesson to\par
be learned that will pay dividends later. When setting up interviews\par
or approaching your boss about a raise or promotion, make it\par
Monday or Wednesday for best results. January, February, April,\par
October, and November are the months to stay alert for job changes\par
and opportunities.\par
TRAVEL:\par
You may not get much of an opportunity to travel, at least the\par
first two-thirds of the year. Travel this year comes about under two\par
conditions: an illness of someone close, or a sudden opportunity out\par
of the blue. Travel indicators are strong for January, May, June, and\par
October.\par
The 5 Personal Year\par
THEME:\par
Dramatic changes, freedom, public activity, and travel.\par
DESCRIPTION:\par
If you didn\rquote t get an opportunity to get things off the ground\par
several years ago, you\rquote ll get a second chance now. You\rquote ll sense a\par
change for the better in all your affairs. You\rquote re likely to see more of\par
your activities coming before the public. Life\rquote s lessons will seem\par
easier to learn, and you\rquote ll find yourself more mentally and\par
physically alert to your environment than ever before. If you\rquote re a\par
Gemini or Virgo, or were born on the 5th, 14th, or 23rd of the\par
month, this will prove to be an important cycle indeed.\par
LOVE/RELATIONSHIPS:\par
Since 5 is the number of sexual attraction, you\rquote re likely to\par
experience a number of relationships with members of the opposite\par
sex. Through no fault of your own, your sex appeal will increase\par
during this and next year\rquote s cycle. The tendency here is to attract\par
persons younger than yourself. Look for those born under Taurus,\par
Gemini, Virgo, and Libra, as well as those whose birth date adds up\par
to 5 or 6. Wear bright, shimmering colors during the months of\par
January, March, June, October, and December.\par
HEALTH:\par
There may be problems connected with insomnia, nervous\par
disorders, mental irritability, or exhaustion, even dizziness. Slow\par
down! Rest and relaxing sleep will do more for you than anything\par
else. Since 5 is a very active cycle, a heavy schedule of activities on\par
your cosmic calendar may be at the root of these difficulties. Avoid\par
excess, especially with alcohol, drugs, sex, gambling, and high-risk\par
adventures. During January, April, August, and October, guard your\par
health.\par
CAREER:\par
This is considered one of the best cycles for making changes or\par
improving your job or career prospects. It should be quite easy to\par
sell your ideas, as well as to push your talents, skills, and expertise.\par
Pass your r\f0\'e9sum\'e9 around, for out there in the world someone will be\par
aware of what you can really do. Wednesday and Friday are the best\par
days to look for employment, set up interviews, or ask for a raise,\par
promotion, or transfer. Look for March, May, September, October,\par
and December to be significant for job opportunities and\par
advancements.\par
TRAVEL:\par
As 5 is a number long associated with movement, you\rquote re likely to\par
have more than your share of trips and travel of a personal and\par
business nature this year. These will prove refreshing as well as\par
beneficial. Travel indications are especially strong during April,\par
May, and September.\par
The 6 Personal Year\par
THEME:\par
Duty, domestic activity, family life, and responsibility.\par
DESCRIPTION:\par
When entering a 6 personal year cycle, activities will center\par
around the home, family, loved ones, and romantic episodes.\par
Esthetic appreciation will run high toward anything beautiful, with\par
a strong appeal to the eye. In matters of the home, there are strong\par
indications that you may move out of one and into another. Going\par
back to school, graduating, or taking additional educational courses\par
may also be in store. You\rquote ll receive many invitations to social\par
functions, galas, art openings, festivities, and the like. Attend these\par
functions, since opportunities for advancement are evident. If you\par
were born on the 6th, 15th, or 24th of the month, or should your\par
sign be Taurus, Libra, or Cancer, this is a very important year cycle.\par
LOVE/RELATIONSHIPS:\par
The 6 is the top cycle for matters of love and romance. This is the\par
year for love, engagement, marriage, separation, divorce,\par
pregnancy, birth, abortion, or a change in an existing relationship.\par
Those born under the signs of Taurus, Cancer, and Libra are slated\par
to play more of a key role, as well as those born on dates adding up\par
to 6, 3, and 2. The outstanding months of this cycle are February,\par
May, September, and November. Wear all shades of blue for\par
attraction and assistance.\par
HEALTH:\par
The emphasis during this cycle is on the upper part of the body.\par
The nose, throat, tonsils, upper part of the lungs, breasts, or heart\par
top the list. Depending on your present physical condition (6 has a\par
tendency to put on weight later in life), problems could develop\par
with irregular blood circulation or heart palpitations. Plenty of\par
sunlight, fresh air, and outdoor physical activity should offset much\par
of the above. This year, keep an eye on things during March, July,\par
September, and December.\par
CAREER:\par
Recognition, promotions, or improvements in your job or career\par
should come into play. Your financial rewards will come through\par
fulfilling your obligations and commitments to the letter. There\rquote s\par
praise in store for you. Should you be looking for work, setting up\par
an important interview, or simply asking for job advancement, your\par
best days are Friday, Thursday, and Monday, in that order. As for\par
longer range indicators, opportunities are equally strong during\par
February, April, August, September, and November.\par
TRAVEL:\par
As this is a domestic, home-loving cycle, trips and travel may be\par
limited in scope. Whatever travel comes into the picture this year\par
will center around family reunions, family illness, funerals, births,\par
marriages, graduations, or perhaps a social function of some sort.\par
Look for these events to manifest themselves during the months of\par
March, April, August, and December.\par
The 7 Personal Year\par
THEME:\par
Inner growth, sabbatical, self-awareness, self-discovery.\par
DESCRIPTION:\par
In a 7 personal year cycle you have a chance to place special\par
emphasis on your personal life and well-being. You\rquote ll find yourself\par
analyzing your past motives and actions, and developing an intense\par
need to be alone to give more time and attention to your own\par
personal needs, goals, and desires. There will be a need to get away\par
from all the noise and confusion. If you visualize what you want this\par
year, you\rquote re likely to get it. This is much better than chasing after\par
what you want. Secrets about yourself and others generally surface\par
in a 7 year. If you were born under the signs of Pisces or Cancer, or\par
on the 7th, 16th, or 25th of the month, this year will be all the more\par
important.\par
LOVE/RELATIONSHIPS:\par
This is not the best personal year for love and romance since 7 is\par
generally a loner cycle. As the 7 is a more spiritual indicator than an\par
emotional or material one, any romance that develops this year may\par
not be of a long or permanent nature. Possibly the best way of\par
getting what you want romantically is to put it in your mind\rquote s eye,\par
to visualize your ideal romantic mate. Whatever romantic interests\par
do come along this year will be with those born on dates adding up\par
to 2, 7, or 4, as well as those born under Cancer and Pisces. Watch\par
for possible romantic hints during January, April, August, and\par
October.\par
HEALTH:\par
Since you\rquote re transiting a rather quiet, somber year, any irritations\par
or changes of the health may come through worry or annoyances.\par
It\rquote s important to maintain a calm, meditative state of mind for best\par
results. If not, you may create problems for yourself by imagining\par
the worst. Find time alone to energize and restore your cosmic cells.\par
Health changes are indicated for February, June, August, and\par
November.\par
CAREER:\par
When passing through this cycle, two things tend to happen: a\par
retirement or a slowing down by taking a leave of absence or a\par
sabbatical from work; and you will also develop a deeper awareness\par
about your skills and occupational expertise\f1\emdash an understanding of\par
your true role and purpose comes to light. Perhaps more than any\par
other cycle other than the 1, inner discoveries and long-sought\par
secrets are finally unearthed. Therefore it\rquote s best to have an\par
investigative and exploratory attitude toward your work. Schedule\par
Monday and Friday for interviews and job hunting or for seeking a\par
raise, promotion, or unveiling a new discovery. January, March,\par
July, August, October, and December are favorable for such job\par
matters.\par
TRAVEL:\par
You\rquote ll find frequent trips to the countryside or to the sea soothing\par
and refreshing to the mind, body, and spirit. In traveling this year,\par
you may develop a strong interest in the customs and cultures of\par
other nations. Erotic, faraway places and islands will have a\par
magnetic, mysterious appeal at this time. Travel is indicated this\par
year during the months of February, April, June, and November.\par
The 8 Personal Year\par
THEME:\par
Achievement, career, major moves, power, recognition.\par
DESCRIPTION:\par
Consider this your \ldblquote power year\rdblquote  cycle\emdash the chance to do and\par
achieve something big in your life. If you were born on the 8th,\par
17th, or 26th of the month, or come under the sign of Capricorn,\par
pay more attention to this cycle year. You should develop maturity\par
and a deeper sense of destiny or faith in yourself and in events\par
about to happen. Not only is this cycle year associated with money\par
and career, but debts out of the past. For instance, an old debt or\par
responsibility avoided in the past may appear. But whatever you do\par
this cycle year, aim for the Sun\emdash think positive, think large, think\par
success!\par
LOVE/RELATIONSHIPS:\par
This personal year cycle is strongly associated with marriage,\par
divorce, and pregnancy. Romantically, those who are older than\par
yourself or someone of influence or wealth should be very\par
appealing. This cycle puts you in touch with those you know from\par
the past\emdash a long-lost relative, a romance from long ago, or even an\par
old school friend. You\rquote ll find no problems romantically this year\par
with Capricorns or Librans, or with those whose dates of birth add\par
up to 8, 6, or 3. Wear deep blues, black, and other dark colors for\par
attraction. Romance is likely to develop during March, July,\par
September, and December.\par
HEALTH:\par
This is the cycle that usually brings on headaches, constipation,\par
problems connected with the liver, blood, and excretory parts of the\par
system. In addition, there may be concerns with the knees, teeth,\par
and bones. Deep moods of despondency and feelings of intense\par
loneliness emerge in this cycle. Furthermore, there\rquote s a likelihood of\par
receiving the wrong drug prescription or medical treatment during\par
surgery. Be careful of your diet and maintain a positive mental\par
attitude for balance. Watch your health during January, May, July,\par
and October.\par
CAREER:\par
This cycle is considered the best when it comes to making money,\par
getting a big raise, or achieving authority over others. This is your\par
year for recognition as a result of your work efforts. And since 8 is\par
an executive number, act the part for your own financial success.\par
Set large goals for yourself this year, you\rquote ll be surprised how close\par
you come. Looking for work? Setting up an interview? Want to ask\par
your boss for a raise? Save Saturday, Thursday, and Friday for such\par
matters. Watch for job or career opportunities during February,\par
June, July, September, and November.\par
TRAVEL:\par
As 8 is considered an Earth number, travel overland would\par
perhaps be best this year. As a rule, 8 is not a travel number, so\par
journeys are more likely to occur in connection with property,\par
legacies, or funerals. On the other hand, there could be travel\par
related to business or to receiving an award, plaque, or certificate.\par
Look for these occurrences during the months of January, February,\par
June, October, and November.\par
The 9 Personal Year\par
THEME:\par
Completions, dreams fulfilled, endings, inspiration, long trips.\par
DESCRIPTION:\par
With the exception of the master number cycles of 11 and 22, the\par
9 cycle is the highest you can go. The 9 year generally symbolizes a\par
completion of sorts, either in your personal or business affairs. Your\par
capacity to let go of persons, habits, negative circumstances, or\par
conditions that you\rquote ve outgrown will be strong. During this cycle,\par
develop the humanitarian side of your nature, learn to give more of\par
yourself to others without expecting payment in return. Cosmically,\par
you\rquote ll be rewarded if you do. If you\rquote re an Aries or a Scorpio, or born\par
on the 9th, 18th, or 27th of the month, this should be a significant\par
year cycle.\par
LOVE/RELATIONSHIPS:\par
The 9 cycle is universal in influence and appeal. As a result,\par
getting involved with the opposite sex outside your own religious,\par
cultural, or ethnic group may be indicated. This is because the 9\par
relates to humanity, and it overshadows prejudice and ignorance.\par
Cosmically, Aries, Leo, and Scorpio are likely to be more involved in\par
your domestic affairs, as well as those whose birth dates add up to\par
9, 3, and 1. For help and attraction, wear all shades of red, from\par
pink to deep crimson. February, June, August, and November will\par
be more eventful from a romantic point of view.\par
HEALTH:\par
During this cycle, the rule is to avoid accidents at all costs, as well\par
as altercations and arguments with others. Be careful how you drive,\par
and how you handle knives, scissors, and other sharp instruments\emdash\par
even guns. The 9 is a fire number, so be careful of anything to do\par
with fire\emdash even smoking in bed. This cycle also brings on\par
inflammations and fevers. Rash, impulsive statements or actions can\par
equally undermine your physical health and mental well-being.\par
Patience will reward you with fewer injuries, arguments, and\par
accidents. Be especially careful during April, June, and September.\par
CAREER:\par
Since this is a fulfillment cycle, most of your dreams in terms of\par
career goals and innermost plans are likely to come true. Yet, at the\par
same time, this is also an indicator of career termination,\par
retirement, or job loss. However, for overall success this is an\par
excellent period for marketing your professional skills or expertise\par
on a broader, more universal scale. Cooperating and sharing more\par
with your co-workers will also accelerate your career. Tuesday and\par
Thursday are your best days if you\rquote re in the process of looking for\par
work, setting up an interview, or asking your present employer for\par
that well-deserved raise. Job changes take on significance during\par
January, May, June, August, and October.\par
TRAVEL:\par
If you\rquote ve been wanting to take a long trip, go off to a distant land,\par
this is your year. As 9 is a long-distance and travel number, getting\par
away this year should be quite easy. If you don\rquote t get to travel this\par
year, chances are someone from afar will visit you or get in touch.\par
This cycle number also brings you in contact with famous\par
personalities. Travel indicators are strong during January, May,\par
July, September, and October.\par
The 11 Personal Year\par
THEME:\par
Abstract impressions, revelations, spiritual awakening.\par
DESCRIPTION:\par
This is a special cycle year because it doesn\rquote t come often. You\rquote ll\par
have a deeper sense of mission and purpose, more inspiration and\par
initiative in wanting to help others by lighting the way. If you were\par
born on the 11th of any month, or come under the signs of Leo and\par
Aquarius, this year will be all the more important. Ideas and\par
hunches will come with lightning speed. Write them down\par
